      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what about the other side though? some parents are really worried that if we only focus on the bad stuff, it'll just make the kids feel guilty or like they hate their own country. doesn't a curriculum that emphasizes our shared values and successes help build a sense of unity and patriotism?",
